'@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 启动充电时序图
actor 用户 as U
participant 前端 as FE
participant 充电控制器 as Ctrl
participant 充电服务 as Service
participant 用户服务 as US
participant 充电桩服务 as CS
database 数据库 as DB

U -> FE: 选择充电桩，点击"启动充电"
FE -> Ctrl: POST /charges/start {userId, chargerId}
Ctrl -> Service: 启动充电请求

Service -> US: 查询用户信息
US -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
DB --> US: 用户信息
US --> Service: 用户存在，余额 >= 10元

Service -> CS: 查询充电桩状态
CS -> DB: SELECT status FROM chargers WHERE id = ?
DB --> CS: status = idle
CS --> Service: 桩空闲

Service -> CS: 锁定充电桩
CS -> DB: UPDATE chargers SET status = 'charging' WHERE id = ? AND status = 'idle'
DB --> CS: 更新成功

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO charge_records (id, user_id, charger_id, start_time, status)
DB --> Service: 创建成功

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs ... action='start_charge'
Service --> Ctrl: 启动成功 {recordId, startTime}

Ctrl --> FE: 充电已启动 {recordId, startTime}
FE --> U: 显示"充电中"状态
@enduml